---
// 左に縦バーを添えたセクション見出し。ページタイトルはlevel=1、ページ内セクションはlevel=2
interface Props {
	level?: 1 | 2;
	class?: string;
}

const { level = 2, class: className } = Astro.props;
const Heading = level === 1 ? "h1" : "h2";
---

<Heading class:list={["text-heading flex items-center gap-3", className]}>
	<span class="w-1 self-stretch rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"
	></span>
	<slot />
</Heading>
